  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The output characteristics of a transistor is shown in the figure. When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi>CE</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.0</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>mA</mi></math>, then value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mi>ac</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/aee8c7ad-f3f8-4ba3-b70d-a1f30aa48b0a-image.png\" style=\"width: 446px; height: 280px;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "150",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From the formula of current gain,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>&#916;i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><msub><mi>&#916;i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi>CE</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#916;i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#916;i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#916;i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#916;i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#916;i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>&#916;i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><msub><mi>&#916;i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi>CE</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></math></p>",
